WEBVTT

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:22.250
A single card turned my life upside-down.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:30.430
Due to this card, my father and mother 
lost their lives, and they're chasing me.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.310
But I'm different now.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.510
I'm no longer a weakling 
that they're chasing.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.830
Why are you here?

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.180
I want to ask you something.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.570
Answer me!  What's this card?

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.700
I don't know!

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.090
Don't act dumb!

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.870
You're chasing me because you want this card!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.910
Wait!

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.860
I'll answer, so don't take my life!

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:06.050
I was ordered to acquire that card.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.230
But I don't know who hired me!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.040
I think it's someone scary and dangerous!

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:11.710
Is that everything?

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:17.570
Yeah.  If you value your life, you 
should stop your investigation.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.270
Sorry, but I'm willing to risk my life.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.730
In order to get my revenge.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:25.850
Stop!

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.250
Don't dirty your hands with 
someone so pathetic, Sherry.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.740
He doesn't know anything.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.810
We'll have to analyze this card ourselves.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:48.350
There's no machine that can analyze it.

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.710
There's one machine in this city that can.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.390
It's a super computer that 
can analyze anything.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.070
The Public Maintenance Department.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.090
Are you serious?

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:23.050
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:28.590
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:33.060
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:38.900
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:43.880
There's no need to fear

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:51.550
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:57.560
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:03.330
Streak to the infinite future

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:08.730
Dreams surpass their limits

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:16.840
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:49.010
Tremble!  Master and Servant's Resolve!!

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.600
So you haven't regained your memories yet.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.430
I can't remember anything.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:59.130
Has Security found any leads?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:05.130
We compared his fingerprints and facial 
photos with the database, but there were no matches.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.930
I see.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.320
We'll keep investigating.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:14.300
Can you let him stay with 
you for a while longer?

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.060
Leave it to me.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:25.160
What is it?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:32.660
When I look into the distance, I think 
that there may be someone waiting for me.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:34.590
Don't get impatient.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.680
You will find the truth someday.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.130
I'll find the truth someday...

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.040
Gather all the documents for this case!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.470
This is the Special Investigation Division.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.000
What is it?

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:55.830
Big trouble!  We received a bomb threat 
at the Public Maintenance Department!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.380
Are you sure it's not a prank?

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.310
We're confirming right now.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:05.170
Hello?

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:08.960
It's true.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.860
Who are you?

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:14.000
I already planted several bombs.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.110
That's nonsense!  There's 
no way you can do that!

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.940
Shall we confirm that?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:28.970
Ushio!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.580
Everyone, evacuate!

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.610
Bombs have been planted in the building.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.540
Evacuate immediately.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.460
Bombs?

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.020
Oh no!

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.880
Chief, everyone in our 
division has evacuated.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:48.420
Right.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.680
What are the criminal's demands?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.680
Nothing yet!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.970
Deputy director, it'll take time 
for the bomb squad to arrive!

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.540
Deputy director, the news agencies 
are asking for comments!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.170
Deputy director!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.970
I feel bad for the deputy director.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.750
We don't know where the real director is.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:10.980
Vice Director Jaeger took a long vacation, 
and we don't know when he'll return.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:14.040
What's going on with the Public 
Maintenance Department?

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.750
Why did the shutters close?

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.600
Can it be?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.580
They're in chaos.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.090
Come to think of it, we're the directors.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.580
The round-headed clown is still in hiding.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:36.610
We can't use him.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.510
Leave them alone.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:42.080
We don't have time to deal 
with their foolishness.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.290
Hurry, Yusei!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.080
Right!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.370
Those two...

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.810
Do you know them?

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.600
Yeah.  I'll call them back!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.570
Wait!  The bombs are going to explode!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.390
Okay.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.580
All the locks in the basement are unlocked.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:10.370
Let's go.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:11.840
Sherry!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.650
Oh, Yusei Fudo.  Long time, no see.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.610
Have you decided to join my team?

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.590
This isn't the time for that!

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.280
We have to escape immediately!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.260
There are bombs here!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.400
That's just a scare tactic.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.240
There are no bombs here.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.190
You did this?  Why?

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:38.250
Sorry, but I don't have 
time to talk about it.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:39.320
Wait!

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:42.080
You'll be punished for causing a commotion!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:43.980
I'm prepared for that.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:47.570
Sherry!

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:56.480
He escaped.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.940
Bruno, stop Sherry!

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.930
Understood!  Leave it to me!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.700
Oh well.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.900
She can handle him.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.590
However, Yusei Fudo...

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.520
I can't allow you to pass.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.170
I can't open that door unless 
you have 0 life points.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.750
Correct.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:34.000
I can't let a duelist like 
Sherry commit more crimes.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.420
I'll get past you, no matter what!

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:37.830
Duel!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.820
I'll go first.  I draw!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.870
I summon Spirit Summit Warrior from my hand!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.530
I activate Spirit Summit Warrior's effect!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:55.700
I Special Summon a Level 3-or-below 
Warrior-Type monster from my hand.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:04.190
Level 3 Liberated Rear Warrior tunes 
Level 4 Spirit Summit Warrior!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:12.720
When two swords cross, the 
loyal sword appears!  Serve me!

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.340
Synchro Summon!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.380
Appear, Driven Daredevil!

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:21.500
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:23.260
My turn!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:29.420
I send Quillbolt Hedgehog from my hand to the 
graveyard to Special Summon Quickdraw Synchron!

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:39.920
When a Tuner is on my field, I can Special 
Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:45.330
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.260
Our thoughts combine to 
call forth a new power!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:57.830
Become the path that lights the way!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.420
Synchro Summon!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.310
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.050
Nitro Warrior attacks Driven Daredevil!

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.740
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.770
I can't allow you to pass!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.690
I activate Driven Daredevil's effect!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.180
Determined Will!

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:22.850
What?

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:28.310
When a monster with higher 
attack points attacks Driven

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:32.190
Daredevil, it's not destroyed, and 
your attacking monster is destroyed!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.010
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Master and Servant's Resolve!

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:43.740
When a monster effect 
destroys a monster during

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:46.260
battle, its controller takes damage 
equal to its attack points!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:54.960
I have to take 1000 points of damage 
every turn to keep this card.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.840
That means your life points 
will run out in four turns!

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.340
Sever the flesh to maintain the bones.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:05.530
That's the true worth of a samurai's deck!

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:12.310
He's willing to go this far.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:20.640
The building was sealed 
due to the bomb threat.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:24.610
This is what the criminal 
wanted.  Something is going on.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.710
Ushio!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.460
Someone is accessing the main 
computer in the basement.

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:34.340
What?  No one can access it from the outside!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:38.030
That's right.  The bomb threat was fake.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.560
The criminal is inside!

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.540
Hurry!  The criminal is inside!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.420
I'll finally discover the truth.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.060
Wait!  You're committing a crime!

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.720
Wait!  Time out!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.410
I summon Tricular in defense position!

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.950
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:15.400
My turn!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:21.770
In order to keep Master and Servant's 
Resolve, I take 1000 points of damage!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.450
Driven Daredevil attacks Tricular!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:34.800
When Tricular is destroyed in battle, I 
can Special Summon Bicular from my deck!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.760
I activate the trap Reversal Sword!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:40.860
On the turn that your monster 
is destroyed in battle, a

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:44.330
monster with lower Level than the 
destroyed monster is destroyed!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:51.450
Both players take damage equal to the 
destroyed monster's attack points.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.420
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.060
He's destroying every one of my monsters.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.730
He's giving me no chances.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.670
Bomb squad, hurry!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.320
We're arresting the criminal!  
Don't fall behind!

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.550
It started.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.000
I said wait!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.290
What is it?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.140
Sherry, Security is coming.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.750
Hurry up and prepare to escape.

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:30.730
Understood, but I couldn't analyze it 
yet because there's someone in my way.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.560
But...

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.450
I can't give up.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.240
Understood.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.010
You're planning to continue the duel?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.400
Even if you stop me, it's only a 
matter of time until you're caught!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.880
That's a sacrifice I'm willing to make.

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:50.640
I must allow her to solve 
the mystery of that card.

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:52.220
Card?

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:55.080
I'll tell you.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.880
Let's stop.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.290
If you don't hurry up and 
escape, they'll catch you!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:06.080
Mizoguchi will risk his 
life to stop Security.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.490
I won't let his sacrifice go to waste.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.820
Why are you willing to go this far?

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:14.350
My parents were killed over a single card.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:20.040
If I analyze that card, I can get my parents' 
revenge and get closer to Iliaster's identity.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:23.450
That's why I won't let anyone interfere!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.390
He's going to beat me.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.010
Give it back.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:03.800
That card holds the truth 
that I've been searching for.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.240
The truth that you've been searching for...

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.780
What are you planning to do?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:25.360
This machine is too difficult for you.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.810
I'll do it.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:28.960
Why?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.190
I don't know myself.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:36.180
But everyone has the right to 
know the truth about themselves.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:39.320
It's true for me and true for you.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.420
You're here to get closer to Iliaster?

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.170
To get revenge?

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.450
Please understand how she feels.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:54.690
If you really care about Sherry, 
why don't you stop her?

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.440
I can't tell you.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.080
Then I'll use all my power to get past you!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:02.480
My turn!

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:03.940
Good.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.700
I summon Debris Dragon from my hand!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.240
Due to Debris Dragon's 
effect, I Special Summon a

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.330
monster with 500-or-fewer attack 
points from my graveyard!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.810
Return, Tricular!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.990
When I successfully summon a monster,

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:25.800
I can Special Summon Turbo 
Booster from my hand that turn!

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:33.840
Level 4 Debris Dragon tunes Level 1 
Turbo Booster and Level 3 Tricular!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.790
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.550
Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:43.460
Synchro Summon!

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:46.280
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.780
Stardust Dragon.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:55.980
That's right.  Stardust Dragon negates 
and destroys card-destroying effects.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:17:01.740
If I attack Driven Daredevil, its 
effect will destroy Stardust Dragon.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:09.150
But Stardust Dragon will negate the 
card-destroying effect and destroy Driven Daredevil.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.980
Then due to Master and Servant's 
Resolve's effect, you

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:16.480
will take damage equal to Driven 
Daredevil's 2400 attack points.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.060
You'll have 0 life points.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.520
Try it.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:25.400
If I use my set card to stop 
Stardust Dragon's effect...

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.840
...and then use Driven Daredevil's 
effect to destroy it...

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:32.010
...you'll take Master and 
Servant's Resolve's effect.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.470
You'll have 0 life points.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.970
A single moment will determine the winner.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.990
Exactly.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:50.140
Stardust Dragon!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.010
Shooting Sonic!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.310
I activate the trap Standoff!

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.830
I activate Driven Daredevil's effect!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:09.840
A monster with greater 
attack points can't destroy

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:12.670
it in battle, and your attacking 
monster is destroyed!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:17.150
By releasing Stardust Dragon, the 
destruction effect is negated!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:24.120
Too bad, but Standoff prevents 
you from releasing your card!

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.130
I won't take a step back!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:31.900
Take this!  Determined Will!

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:44.510
The Counter Trap Space Jump!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.930
I remove Stardust Dragon from play, and you 
take damage equal to its attack points!

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.590
You may pass.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.450
But please let her go.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:14.510
I never said that I would 
hand you over to Security.

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:15.430
What?

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:19.140
Let's go.  You're the only 
one who can stop Sherry.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.640
The analysis result is...

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:27.360
No way!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.500
This is a lie!  The analysis is wrong!

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.970
There's nothing special about 
this card?  That's impossible!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.850
What's going on?

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.560
Sherry!  Bruno!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.460
Miss!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:49.260
What's this?

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.290
Miss!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.640
Where are we?

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:07.840
I don't know.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.000
We're supposed to be in the computer room.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.510
What's that?

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:41.440
What's this?

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:51.600
Where are we?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.770
You've regained consciousness.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:58.230
Mizoguchi, you saved us?

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:02.920
No.  When I regained consciousness, 
we were already here.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:05.580
She's exhausted.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:10.210
Yusei Fudo, I owe you.

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.300
We'll eventually meet again.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:24.300
What did we see inside that light?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:25.960
I don't know.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:30.690
But maybe he's the one who helped us escape.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.400
Him?

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.010
Sherry wanted to analyze a card 
that was a clue towards Iliaster.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:44.820
Did this event have something 
to do with Iliaster?

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:13.240
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:18.250
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:23.150
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:28.160
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:33.030
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:39.970
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:43.840
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:49.710
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:53.620
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:59.590
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:02.560
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:04.800
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:09.470
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:12.340
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:15.810
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:19.040
At our special place
